{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is insertOne?","A CRUD operation that inserts one document into a collection."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about insertOne?","If the document lacks _id, the driver or server can add one before storage."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nIf the document lacks _id, the driver or server can add one before storage.","insertOne"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
