{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is insertMany?","A CRUD operation that inserts multiple documents in one call."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about insertMany?","Batching inserts can reduce round trips compared with issuing one insert per document."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nBatching inserts can reduce round trips compared with issuing one insert per document.","insertMany"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
