{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is find?","A query operation that returns a cursor over all documents matching a filter."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about find?","Use projection, sort, and limit with find to control returned fields, order, and result size."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nUse projection, sort, and limit with find to control returned fields, order, and result size.","find"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
