{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is findOne?","A query operation that returns a single matching document rather than a cursor of many results."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about findOne?","findOne is convenient when the application expects at most one relevant result."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
