{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is updateOne?","A CRUD operation that modifies at most one document matching a filter."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about updateOne?","Use update operators such as $set when only selected fields should change."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"crud\"]"}
