{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Aggregation accumulators?","Operators such as $sum, $avg, $min, $max, $first, and $last that compute values across grouped or windowed inputs."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"aggregation\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Aggregation accumulators?","Accumulators are most commonly seen in $group and window-function contexts."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"aggregation\"]"}
