{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is explain?","A facility that shows how MongoDB plans or executes a query, including winning plans and execution statistics."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"performance\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about explain?","Use explain to verify whether an index is used and to compare documents examined versus documents returned."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"performance\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nUse explain to verify whether an index is used and to compare documents examined versus documents returned.","explain"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"performance\"]"}
