{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Change stream?","A resumable stream of data-change notifications built on replication metadata."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"replication\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Change stream?","Change streams let applications react to inserts, updates, replacements, and deletes without polling collections repeatedly."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"replication\"]"}
