{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Sharding?","MongoDB's horizontal scaling mechanism for distributing collection data across multiple shards."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Sharding?","Sharding increases scale and distribution but makes shard-key choice a critical design decision."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nSharding increases scale and distribution but makes shard-key choice a critical design decision.","Sharding"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
