{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Shard?","A component that stores a subset of sharded-cluster data, typically implemented as a replica set."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Shard?","Using replica sets for shards provides high availability within each shard."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nUsing replica sets for shards provides high availability within each shard.","Shard"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
