{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is mongos?","The stateless query router that application clients use to access a sharded MongoDB cluster."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about mongos?","mongos routes operations to the relevant shards based on metadata and the query's shard-key information."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nmongos routes operations to the relevant shards based on metadata and the query's shard-key information.","mongos"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
