{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Config server?","A member of the config server replica set that stores sharded-cluster metadata."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Config server?","Config servers track topology and chunk placement information used by mongos routers."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
