{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Shard key?","The field or fields whose values determine how a sharded collection is partitioned and routed."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Shard key?","A good shard key supports even distribution, useful targeting, and sustainable write throughput."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nA good shard key supports even distribution, useful targeting, and sustainable write throughput.","Shard key"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
