{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Ranged sharding?","A sharding strategy that divides shard-key values into contiguous ranges."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Ranged sharding?","Range-based sharding supports targeted range queries well but can create hotspots when shard-key values grow monotonically."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nRange-based sharding supports targeted range queries well but can create hotspots when shard-key values grow monotonically.","Ranged sharding"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"cloze","fields":["{{c1::Ranged sharding}}: A sharding strategy that divides shard-key values into contiguous ranges.","Key fact: Range-based sharding supports targeted range queries well but can create hotspots when shard-key values grow monotonically."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Hashed sharding?","A sharding strategy that distributes documents using a hash of the shard-key value."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Hashed sharding?","Hashed sharding tends to improve distribution for monotonically changing keys but loses efficient range locality on the original value."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nHashed sharding tends to improve distribution for monotonically changing keys but loses efficient range locality on the original value.","Hashed sharding"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
