{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Chunk?","A logical contiguous range of shard-key values used as a unit of data distribution."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Chunk?","Chunks can be split and moved among shards as the cluster balances data."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nChunks can be split and moved among shards as the cluster balances data.","Chunk"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
