{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Balancer?","The sharded-cluster process that redistributes chunks or ranges to maintain balanced data placement."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Balancer?","Balancing helps prevent long-term uneven data distribution across shards."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"type-answer","fields":["Name the concept described by this key fact:\nBalancing helps prevent long-term uneven data distribution across shards.","Balancer"],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
