{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What is Zone sharding?","A mechanism that associates shard-key ranges with named zones tied to particular shards."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["What should you remember about Zone sharding?","Zones can keep selected data on designated shards for locality, hardware, or governance requirements."],"tags_json":"[\"mongodb\",\"sharding\"]"}
